| Name         | Description                         | Units  |   Default value |
| ------------ | ----------------------------------- | ------ | --------------- |
| `Rm`         | Armature resistance                         | Ω  |   8.4 |
| `kt`         | Current-to-torque constant                         | N.m/A  |   0.042 |

